	abstract = {Photoelectric observations on the UB V system are given for the double-line eclipsing binary V382 Cygni. The observational procedure and relation of the instrumental system to the UB V system are described. The time of secondary minimum does not fall at phase 0.5 and is found to be a function of wavelength. The color-index-curves indicate tbe two components to be essentially alike. The light-curves undergo continuous variation. The minima are asymmetric; secondary minimum is of greater duration than primary minimum. The light in the maximum shows a reflection effect (cos 0 term) which has a sign opposite that expected by theory. A tentative orbital solution is presented.},
